{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/487863-who-will-get-to-see-the-sardonyx-system-first","id":487863,"title":"Who will get to see the Sardonyx system first?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-21T19:43:11-07:00","id":487863,"title":"Who will get to see the Sardonyx system first?","content":"I assume it's coming along. Who is going to see it first, the Scion fans or the Trinity fans? Or will it be linked to both?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-21T22:37:07-07:00","id":487991,"title":"","content":"(Purely speculative - I have no inside knowledge) Since the Sardonyx system is meant for both, I'd guess that when it's ready it will be linked for play test on the OP front page as an open development post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-22T05:06:40-07:00","id":488177,"title":"","content":"Me of course. <b><i>I'll</i></b> get to see it first....me, just me. <i>Muahahahah</i>. I have my spies and satellites tracking the development team's every little move - some of them are sneaky, and manage to shake off my efforts for a day here and there, but I always track them down again. This is especially true of Neall, that one's a slippery customer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> .....Um... yeah, no idea.<br /> <br /> As Bunyip said, it sounds like it'll show up in open development at some point in the near(ish) future letting us have at the core mechanics so we can provide feedback. I don't think there's been anything officially announced regarding 'the plan' yet, given its a work in progress behind the scenes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-22T10:14:46-07:00","id":488427,"title":"","content":"When Neall and Ritche said that i could bribe Neall as long as it &quot;kept to the plan&quot;, I started thinking of season 1-2 of Arrow and the Sundering of the Glades...Ritch is now Merlyn, and Neall...you are so Ollie's mom! (Metaphorically speaking)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/cor