":"2015-04-22T16:01:35-07:00","id":488812,"title":"","content":"Hard to say, since I'm not sure it needs to be codified into a book, or rather that the first sets are going to be different books. So far, we just have this rule set sort of floating in space. So if we have to wait for everything else to be written, that might be awhile. On the flip side, if Open Development is similar to the development side, I suspect we should start seeing things not too much longer than now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}